# aPToP Exercise 6(j) solution.
# One Netty law per step. Book "symmetry" rearrangement is associative here.

laws boolean

theorem ex6j: (a ⇒ b) ∨ (b ⇒ a)
    (a ⇒ b) ∨ (b ⇒ a)              inclusion
=   (¬a ∨ b) ∨ (b ⇒ a)             inclusion
=   (¬a ∨ b) ∨ (¬b ∨ a)            associative
=   ¬a ∨ a ∨ b ∨ ¬b                excluded middle
=   ⊤ ∨ b ∨ ¬b                     excluded middle
=   ⊤ ∨ ⊤                          idempotent
=   ⊤
